---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Practical answers for the house and the yard
metaTitle: Daily Insight Desk — Home & Garden Guides
description: Practical home and garden guides for U.S. households, covering cleaning, the kitchen, the yard, and tools. Clear answers, labeled affiliate links, and no invented tests.
date: 2026-11-18
updated: 2026-11-18
lcp: /assets/images/hero-patio
lcpSizes: "(min-width: 960px) 42rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)"
ogAlt: Illustration of a wooden table by an open door, with a cutting board, a brass watering can, and a coiled garden hose on a brick patio.
permalink: /
---
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Home &amp; garden · United States</p>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <p class="dek">Daily Insight Desk explains ordinary jobs in plain English. A product shows up only when it fits the task, and the link is labeled as an ad.</p>
        <p class="meta-row"><span>Four shelves</span><span>Two starter guides</span><span>No invented tests</span></p>
      </div>
      <figure class="frame">
        <img
          src="/assets/images/hero-patio-800.webp"
          srcset="/assets/images/hero-patio-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/hero-patio-1600.webp 1600w"
          sizes="(min-width: 960px) 42rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)"
          alt="Illustration of a wooden table by an open door, with a cutting board, a brass watering can, and a coiled garden hose on a brick patio"
          width="1600"
          height="900"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async">
        <figcaption>Original illustration. Not a product photo and not a test.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="shelves-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="shelves-title">The four shelves</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="shelf">
        {% for shelf in silos %}
        <a class="shelf-card" href="/{{ shelf.slug }}/">
          <img
            src="{{ shelf.image }}-800.webp"
            srcset="{{ shelf.image }}-800.webp 800w, {{ shelf.image }}-1600.webp 1600w"
            sizes="(min-width: 1040px) 16rem, (min-width: 700px) 45vw, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)"
            alt=""
            width="{{ shelf.width }}"
            height="{{ shelf.height }}"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">Shelf {{ shelf.number }}</p>
            <h2>{{ shelf.name }}</h2>
            <p>{{ shelf.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="guides-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="guides-title">From the desk</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-grid">
        {% for post in collections.guide %}
        <a class="guide-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <img
            src="{{ post.data.hero }}-800.webp"
            srcset="{{ post.data.hero }}-800.webp 800w, {{ post.data.hero }}-1600.webp 1600w"
            sizes="(min-width: 700px) 34rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem)"
            alt=""
            width="1600"
            height="{{ post.data.heroHeight }}"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">{{ post.data.siloName }} · {{ post.data.readTime }}</p>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ post.data.dek }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="trust" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
        <article>
          <h3>The job, then the product</h3>
          <p>Each guide starts with the task. A product is mentioned only if it is one reasonable way to do that task.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>No invented tests</h3>
          <p>If we have not used something, we say so. Numbers and trials are credited to the publication that actually ran them.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Links you can see</h3>
          <p>Affiliate links are marked, including in a note near the top of every guide. The price is the seller’s price.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside class="letter" aria-labelledby="letter-title">
        <p class="stub-flag">Newsletter not open</p>
        <h2 id="letter-title">The household letter is not collecting addresses</h2>
        <p>A short email may come later. There is no list to join on this page, and this note is not a signup form. We will not ask for an email until there is a real letter to send.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
